id":"e2b202fa-195c-4c4e-9ec5-9c2193855b1b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとは let の右辺とかもあるんですが。","ts":"1631776142.084000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hfl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"006ccc44-79d1-4666-b6af-b3effe81ce72","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"もともと基本的に eval は call が起点になってるんです。それ以外の利用方法がなかった。のちに一部のオプションが関数を指定するように=起点になったんですよ。","ts":"1631776113.083400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":4,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","UEACRCY0Z","UKHUVMBJR","UD7AE4MFC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QuD2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1deaf3f9-677e-4240-88f3-63d147541c0b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"いやそういう話でもないか、上の no-eval-feature をちゃんと読まないとだな","ts":"1631775592.081500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yESby"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8be01f40-391e-4132-a0eb-a40b4e260a51","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"その意味だと\n```Vim script                              *expression* *expr* *E15* *eval*\n \nVim script の利用についてはユーザーマニュアルの41章|usr_41.txt|でも解説され\nている。\n \n注意: Vim script はコンパイル時に無効化できる。もしそうなっているとこのド\nキュメントに書かれている事は有効ではない。|+eval|と|no-eval-feature|を参照。```\nもあって、意味が曖昧になりやすい...\nsetやらが並んでるだけのファイルはVim scriptとは厳密には言わない、んだろうか","ts":"1631775588.081400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q5r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b614a0d7-b5bd-4835-ab94-8019ecc32d3f","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あ、callとeval機能が紐付いてるんですね？","ts":"1631775470.079700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ctrg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56c50247-b77f-4a58-b2a6-64b757cd9f82","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"複数のコマンドをファイルとかに並べたのがVim scriptで、コマンドの一部(`:call`)としてeval機能が実装されているのですよ。","ts":"1631775325.078900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1631775361.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UD7AE4MFC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"serS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc1e5c9b-c286-46ca-b68c-b3dab98363bb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"関数定義機能もevalの一部ですね、functionコマンド自体の定義は外にあるというだけで","ts":"1631774742.077700","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1631774759.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UD7AE4MFC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qU="}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bdb83e8-f4d5-4dcf-9842-72e5c7a79ce1","type":"message","user":"UD7AE4MFC","text":"\u0026gt; 3. だけどコマンドだと結果を返したりができないので、関数という枠組みをつくった\nは，しっくり来ました．\n一方，eval機能という単語は知らなかったので調べつつ考えているんですが，eval機能=Vimscriptくらいの理解しかできないです…\n\u0026gt; コマンドは生えてるけど使えない状態になるっぽい\nから，コマンドの定義はeval機能の外で実行自体はeval機能の一部という認識で大丈夫ですか？","ts":"1631774674.077000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3qotH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b084bc15-bad2-44d7-bc19-0ed9d1b754ad","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"学びだ","ts":"1631773947.072700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GqML"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n11. +eval機能が無効                             *no-eval-feature*\n \nコンパイル時に|+eval|機能が無効とされている場合、全ての式評価(eval)コマンドは\n提供されない。その場合、Vim script が全ての種類のエラーを引き起こすことを避\nける為、\":if\" と \":endif\" は解釈される。\":if\" とそれに対応する \":endif\" に挟ま\nれた内容は無視される。\":if\" の後に続く引数も無視される。この \":if\" コマンドは\nネスティングが可能である。しかし必ず行の先頭に書かれている必要がある。\":else\"\nコマンドは認識されない。\n \n|+eval| 機能が存在しなかった場合、どのようにコマンドが実行を免れるかの例:  \n \n        :if 1\n        :  echo \"Expression evaluation is compiled in\"\n        :else\n        :  echo \"You will _never_ see this message\"\n        :endif\n \n|+eval| 機能が無効になっている場合にのみコマンドを実行するには、2つの方法があ\nる。最も簡単なのは、スクリプト(またはVim)を途中で終了することである:  \n        if 1\n           echo \"commands executed with +eval\"\n           finish\n        endif\n        args  \" command executed without +eval\n \nスクリプトのロードを中止したくない場合は、次の例に示すようなトリックを使用する\nことができる:  \n \n        silent! while 0\n          set history=111\n        silent! endwhile\n \n|+eval| 機能が有効なとき、\"while 0\" のためにコマンドはスキップされる。|+eval|\n機能がない場合、\"while 0\" はエラーとなり黙って無視されるため、コマンドが実行さ\nれる。\n```","ts":"1631773945.072600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"3257e5b1-0818-456e-a13d-1b7a59456236","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":":h no-eval-feature","ts":"1631773944.072400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iF36"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ba2f71f-8766-434c-9a6e-79ee6d5a6202","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なるほどなー…","ts":"1631773889.072200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Fyh"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nVim script                              *expression* *expr* *E15* *eval*\n \nVim script の利用についてはユーザーマニュアルの41章|usr_41.txt|でも解説され\nている。\n \n注意: Vim script はコンパイル時に無効化できる。もしそうなっているとこのド\nキュメントに書かれている事は有効ではない。|+eval|と|no-eval-feature|を参照。\n \nこのファイルは後方互換の Vim script について書かれている。より高速で、型チェッ\nクや多くの機能に対応する Vim9 script については |vim9.txt| を参照のこと。\n \n1.  変数                        |variables|\n    1.1 変数の型\n    1.2 関数への参照                    |Funcref|\n    1.3 リスト                          |Lists|\n    1.4 辞書                            |Dictionaries|\n    1.5 Blobs                           |Blobs|\n    1.6 変数について補足                |more-variables|\n2.  式の文法                    |expression-syntax|\n3.  内部変数                    |internal-variables|\n4.  組み込み関数                |functions|\n5.  関数定義                    |user-functions|\n6.  波括弧{}変数                |curly-braces-names|\n7.  コマンド                    |expression-commands|\n8.  例外処理                    |exception-handling|\n9.  例                          |eval-examples|\n10. Vim scriptバージョン        |vimscript-version|\n11. +eval機能が無効             |no-eval-feature|\n12. サンドボックス              |eval-sandbox|\n13. テキストロック              |textlock|\n \nテストのサポートは |testing.txt| を参照。\nプロファイリングは |profiling| に記録されている。\n```","ts":"1631773875.072000","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"33f3aff9-55ad-46c8-b804-352cf9bb845d","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":":help eval","ts":"1631773874.071900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yre"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nN  *+eval*              式評価 {訳注: Vim script} |eval.txt|\nN  *+ex_extra*          今は常にオン、かつてVimの拡張Exコマンドのためにあった\nN  *+extra_search*      |'hlsearch'| と |'incsearch'| オプション\n-  *+farsi*             削除済み; |farsi| 言語\nN  *+file_in_path*      |gf|, |CTRL-W_f| と |\u0026lt;cfile\u0026gt;|\nN  *+find_in_path*      include ファイル検索: |[I|、|:isearch|、\n                        |CTRL-W_CTRL-I|、|:checkpath|、その他\nN  *+folding*           |folding|\n```","ts":"1631773759.071400","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"bff9d3f0-3c3f-484d-8afb-cd90dbfaf4ff","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":":help +eval","ts":"1631773759.071300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"woA"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *E319*   \n  Sorry, the command is not available in this version\n \n使用中のVimでは利用できないコマンドを使おうとした。Vimのコンパイル時に、いくつ\nもの機能を有効／無効にすることができる。これはVimをどれだけ大きくするかの決定\nとOSに依存する。いつどの機能が利用できるのかを見るには|+feature-list|を参照。\n|:version|コマンドを使うとVimがどの機能つきでコンパイルされたかを表示できる。\n```","ts":"1631773746.071100","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"39acfa84-0fb1-4737-af65-d2b8725e67dc","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":":h E319","ts":"1631773744.071000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QnHw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e60bcb8-b878-499a-bb9f-2145ba44c6e4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"E319が出る","ts":"1631773715.070800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VhHv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df67453a-7ffd-45f9-bfac-a6b334eff35a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"コマンドは生えてるけど使えない状態になるっぽい","ts":"1631773710.070600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eNp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c85ea7d0-3c0c-4a87-9ced-0f9eb57e8820","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"難しい・・・\nfunction構文とかも含めてコマンドで、それはeval機能が評価してるから関数が使えるとかです？\nなんか違う気がする・・・","ts":"1631773597.070200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"58Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0b193c3-baac-4ba3-90a1-036178ca1564","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一方でコマンドは無効にできない。","ts":"1631773387.068900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n6Nt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7fc3f290-0f6a-475a-83ea-c3b9365ce92c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"関数ではなくeval機能なんですよね。eval機能の一部として関数がある。で、eval機能はオプション機能。だからビルド時に無効化できる。","ts":"1631773274.067700","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1631773384.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":3,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U8R597E9H","UD7AE4MFC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sA2k8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f801f24-f1db-4391-9dfc-45e18c6b73a0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たぶん順序が逆で\n1. viのころから、コマンドというもので全体や現バッファや現在行に対して機能を行うもの (ex :grep ) があった\n2. これを列挙してファイルに書けるVim scriptというものにした\n3. だけどコマンドだと結果を返したりができないので、関数という枠組みをつくった\n4. この関数を実行するコマンドとして `:call`  がある (let a = hoge() などの呼びかただとcall は不要というか利用できない)\nじゃないかな....\n歴史的経緯も含めた場合、どうなのかは把握できてないんだけど","ts":"1631773185.066800","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1631773290.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UD7AE4MFC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fmQvb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85d08bee-efaa-4d65-ae0e-bcdca2248301","type":"message","user":"UD7AE4MFC","text":"初歩的な質問だと思うんですけど，vimscriptにおけるコマンドと関数の違いがよくわからないです\n一応，違いとして関数がコマンドモードで (callコマンドを使わないと) 呼び出せないことはわかるのですが，なぜそういうふうに区別して設計したがわかりません\nコマンドと関数の違いと，これらを区別するとどう嬉しいのかも合わせて教えていただけると幸いです","ts":"1631772880.063500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DD=Y+"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02EMBE9L8K","text":"\u003c@U02EMBE9L8K\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1631768544.059300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"d5e30f01-a4d7-4985-94e4-ff517c632fac","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"```git branch foo\ngit worktree add foo ../foo\ncd ../foo```\nってすれば、clean済みに相当する`foo` ブランチ専用ディレクトリでmakeできるので、途中成果物を消さなくてもよさそう","ts":"1631766177.059000","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1631766189.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f2m"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02EEFKG0LW","text":"\u003c@U02EEFKG0LW\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1631765060.056200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"2bacd761-3b18-455d-84e1-00f17c503db1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"でもこれ適当に `(yarn|npm) install` 走らせてるだけのプロジェクトでやっていきたいですね、下手したらnode_modulesが1GBとかになってるんで","ts":"1631762090.054600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LEA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4decd61e-70f4-4676-94b4-6d4043403d69","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"手で編集してたらaho-bakaupで保存してるから助かるんですけど","ts":"1631761720.053800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yHML"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af2634e7-0305-4f6c-adde-b71f6a2482e3","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、今雑にpipe書いてみたけど普通にやるときはxargs使うことになりますね","ts":"1631761680.053300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Fnvq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c3d5897-505a-4601-b00d-ee32bf7b5b5b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"いやそもそも全部消していいなら `-n` 外せばいいだけなんだけども","ts":"1631761662.052900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qJf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d815b14-891a-410d-86c2-386be55082bf","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ビルド用にチェックアウトしたディレクトリのゴミを片付けるのにしか使ってない","ts":"1631761658.052700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gslg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35cf3722-5d5a-4712-9378-d6f904b06c0d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"xargs","ts":"1631761639.051600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XWa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01976ad8-fbd3-48cb-b792-2a9319183aea","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"必要なファイルを吹き飛ばしたことが何度かある…","ts":"1631761625.050900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fV0p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"caddbd85-0d32-4d70-88ef-00abab318d99","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```$ git clean -fdxn\nWould remove .vim/\nWould remove lib/\nWould remove node_modules/\nWould remove rplugin/node/fzf-preview.vim/index.js```\nなんで `cut -f3 | rm` みたいな","ts":"1631761619.050700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bGb+N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe0f2138-6490-4ee4-9c36-6b2bf5679a80","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"作業中ディレクトリではまず使わないな","ts":"1631761618.050600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DaBo/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"110fe356-5a37-4eed-a2f2-61f144645b58","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそも `-dfx` は本質的に危険なので滅多なことがない限り使わない方がいいと言うのが私の考えですw","ts":"1631761595.049600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IVG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b46b1f7-f039-4695-b84f-4318631df284","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"dry-runをpipeしてrmするとかですかねぇ","ts":"1631761557.048500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yIm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a479120-bf97-49f8-a28a-91bf4beb118b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そろそろglobal ignoreに入れそう","ts":"1631761531.048200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ghed"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2847d714-d5c1-46ff-b83c-fdd6b92d3fac","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"タスクランナーとかに専用のコマンド書くくらいしか思い付かない","ts":"1631761526.048100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Jam"}]},{"client_msg_id":"330c2cbd-16be-4545-863c-d0b9698e39c5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"更に言うと.gitignoreには入れてないんですよね、特定のエディタに.gitignoreを汚染させたくないから `.git/info/exclude` に今は入れてる","ts":"1631761511.047800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yRg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9982