delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cS+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12175ec6-7e2d-42f5-8afd-83f513d3150f","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"git からクローンじゃなくてソースの tar を展開してるので、消して tar 展開し直しが安全ですかねえ。","ts":"1631761103.039700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a7Mjc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e69e74ee-e73b-4b1e-a687-bcd8ca23359b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"（今試しにやったら `.vim` が吹っ飛んでやらかした）","ts":"1631761075.038600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":8,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U01ATUT6PL3","UAZ33BKV2","U022XK5866Q","UA1GWETAA","UD1FQV38V","UDPT2BZ6E","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DaF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"831f08fb-6f86-48d6-b482-4dbd1a459ae6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"Tシャツがまたれる?","ts":"1631761066.038300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"prdA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1aa78d6-c392-45cc-aec8-8dad065a8822","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://mapyo.hatenablog.com/entry/2014/08/20/git_clean_%E3%81%A7%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AC%E3%82%AF%E3%83%88%E3%83%AA%E3%82%82%E5%89%8A%E9%99%A4%E5%AF%BE%E8%B1%A1%E3%81%AB%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B\u003e\nmanむずいですね。。\nとりあえず `git clean` は `-f` がないと実際に消してくれなくて、 `-d` でディレクトリ削除、 `-x` で `.gitignore` されてるファイルも削除です。（ `git clone` した状態になる）","ts":"1631761064.038000","attachments":[{"fallback":"画竜点睛を衝く@mapyo: git clean でディレクトリも削除対象にする - 画竜点睛を衝く@mapyo","id":1,"title":"git clean でディレクトリも削除対象にする - 画竜点睛を衝く@mapyo","title_link":"https://mapyo.hatenablog.com/entry/2014/08/20/git_clean_%E3%81%A7%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AC%E3%82%AF%E3%83%88%E3%83%AA%E3%82%82%E5%89%8A%E9%99%A4%E5%AF%BE%E8%B1%A1%E3%81%AB%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B","text":"-dオプションをつけないとディレクトリも対象にならない。 git clean -d -n git clean -d -f こんな感じです。 thanks CmdNote - [git,git-clean] 追跡されていないディレクトリを削除する その他 -xをつけると、.gitignoreで無視される設定のファイルも消すことが出来る。 ヾ(oﾟωﾟo)ﾉﾞ git Untracked files(未追跡ファイル)を1発で消し去る - Qiita","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/12704914408862865162/12921228815730742224/1408493066","blocks":null,"ts":1408492787,"service_name":"画竜点睛を衝く@mapyo","service_icon":"https://mapyo.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://mapyo.hatenablog.com/entry/2014/08/20/git_clean_%E3%81%A7%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AC%E3%82%AF%E3%83%88%E3%83%AA%E3%82%82%E5%89%8A%E9%99%A4%E5%AF%BE%E8%B1%A1%E3%81%AB%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B","original_url":"https://mapyo.hatenablog.com/entry/2014/08/20/git_clean_%E3%81%A7%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AC%E3%82%AF%E3%83%88%E3%83%AA%E3%82%82%E5%89%8A%E9%99%A4%E5%AF%BE%E8%B1%A1%E3%81%AB%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x4=7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"015ab855-2b1a-44f7-8bd4-682e6417fdb7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ignoreになってるbuildとかも含めてサラにする、ってところかな?","ts":"1631761053.037400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XOLQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"237a33cb-11a1-4923-a82d-b933dc790106","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`git clean -dfx` して消しちゃいけないファイルまで吹き飛ばしたことがある人","ts":"1631761052.037300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N+cL5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f01db05-e77d-4545-a3d2-6ea6f1e96434","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"force, dry-runしながらignoreを無視？","ts":"1631760991.035700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"suZZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbf2c82a-83b0-49f3-85a7-72cd69b6de9e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```       -x\n           Don't use the standard ignore rules (see gitignore(5)), but still use the ignore rules given with -e options from the command line. This allows removing all untracked files, including build products. This\n           can be used (possibly in conjunction with git restore or git reset) to create a pristine working directory to test a clean build.```","ts":"1631760909.035100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ua70"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5992efb6-f194-4be7-a0c9-4d86d7c0aba6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"git cleanでもおk","ts":"1631760901.034800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r66F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ede6fe2c-3916-41c8-90d4-fa0241cea721","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ちなみにVimの場合はmake dist-clean(だっけ)しないとconfigureに拒否されます","ts":"1631760892.034400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Lfh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c88a619c-4b47-46d3-893e-b1273a86833a","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`-fdx` 初めて聞いた","ts":"1631760881.034100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Jpsh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c15cb613-6c69-485d-a037-b7f201a2b134","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"configureオプション変えたらやっぱり消すしかないんじゃないでしょうか。。\nあと `make clean` も信用してないので `git clean -fdx` します","ts":"1631760849.033000","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1631760858.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U8996GYBF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3pDwY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8ec614c-8e8e-457f-8cbf-caea85f549ce","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"途中成果物が以前のフラグ類で作られてるのは、いろいろ危険","ts":"1631760849.032900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rey"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cec2fda5-a6ba-4ed9-abfa-2a1ea207ce1e","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"（vim で無理だったら python でも無理そう）","ts":"1631760841.032600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sAi1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cf9c30b-5131-422f-99c2-e1c65d80be22","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"なるほど〜。おとなしく make clean して忍耐の make をするしかなさそうですね。ありがとうございます","ts":"1631760828.031900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I=jt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b13114a-8ca5-4061-a8d2-028f41a35f0c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"物にもよるけど無理なんじゃないかなー(Vimが無理なのは試したので知ってる)","ts":"1631760282.031100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=vIb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5383d55-2f80-4d7b-beba-0d31f7a04ec8","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"Vimに関係ない雑談寄りの質問です。あるソースコードをすでに configure make make install したが、configure のオプションを変えて再インストールしたい場合、単に configure のオブションを変えて再度makeするだけで大丈夫なのでしょうか？　それとも、make clean していったんビルド成果物を消したほうが良いのでしょうか？（ビルドに時間がかかるのでできれば１からは避けたい……）","ts":"1631760172.030200","thread_ts":"1631760172.030200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aglVo"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02EJ2P9WE9","text":"\u003c@U02EJ2P9WE9\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1631759332.025800","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"eb9a558c-21fe-4a32-9538-acfd74e111aa","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"具体的には、python のビルドで --enable -shared をしていなかったのでそれを付加したいってだけです。","ts":"1631760205.030300","thread_ts":"1631760172.030200","parent_user_id":"U01ATUT6PL3","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+PF"}]}]
